{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 52, :comments ["<b>And He spoke, etc., saying.</b> The meaning of ״לֵאמֹר״ is: to Yehoshua and the elders, for he is the one who apportions the land as an inheritance. And one should not explain ״לֵאמֹר״ as referring to Israel, for the phrase ״לָאֵלֶּה״ that He said just nearby contradicts this."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:14:48.940265989Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}